# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid "Installation instructions for the latest version of Samplomatic"
msgstr "Installationsanleitung für die neueste Version von Samplomatic"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Installation instructions"
msgstr "Installationsanleitung"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title #
#, no-wrap
msgid "Installation instructions {#installation-instructions}"
msgstr "Installationsanleitung {#installation-instructions}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Prerequisites {#prerequisites}"
msgstr "Voraussetzungen {#prerequisites}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "First, create a minimal environment with only Python installed in it. We recommend using [Python virtual environments](https://docs.python.org/3.10/tutorial/venv.html).\n"
msgstr "Erstelle zunächst eine minimale Umgebung, in der nur Python installiert ist. Wir empfehlen die Verwendung von [virtuellen Python-Umgebungen](https://docs.python.org/3.10/tutorial/venv.html).\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Activate your new environment.\n"
msgstr "Aktiviere deine neue Umgebung.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "There are two primary ways to install the packages:\n"
msgstr "Es gibt zwei Hauptwege, die Pakete zu installieren:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '*   '
#, no-wrap
msgid "[Option 1: Install from PyPI](#option-1)\n"
msgstr "[Option 1: Installation von PyPI](#option-1)\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '*   '
#, no-wrap
msgid "[Option 2: Install from source](#option-2)\n"
msgstr "[Option 2: Installation aus dem Quellcode](#option-2)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"option-1\" />\n"
msgstr ""

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Option 1: Install from PyPI {#option-1-install-from-pypi}"
msgstr "Option 1: Installation von PyPI {#option-1-install-from-pypi}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The most straightforward way to install the `samplomatic` package is via `PyPI`.\n"
msgstr "Der einfachste Weg, das Paket `samplomatic` zu installieren, führt über `PyPI`.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"option-2\" />\n"
msgstr ""

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Option 2: Install from source {#option-2-install-from-source}"
msgstr "Option 2: Installation aus dem Quellcode {#option-2-install-from-source}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "If you plan to develop in the repository or run the notebooks locally, you should install from source.\n"
msgstr "Wenn du im Repository entwickeln oder die Notebooks lokal ausführen möchtest, solltest du aus dem Quellcode installieren.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "First, clone the `samplomatic` repository.\n"
msgstr "Klone zunächst das Repository `samplomatic`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Next, upgrade pip and enter the repository.\n"
msgstr "Aktualisiere als Nächstes pip und wechsle in das Repository.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The next step is to install `samplomatic` to the virtual environment. If you plan to run the notebooks and their visualizations, install the notebook dependencies. If you plan on developing in the repository, install the `dev` and `vis` dependencies.\n"
msgstr "Der nächste Schritt ist, `samplomatic` in die virtuelle Umgebung zu installieren. Wenn du die Notebooks und ihre Visualisierungen ausführen möchtest, installiere die Notebook-Abhängigkeiten. Wenn du im Repository entwickeln möchtest, installiere die Abhängigkeiten `dev` und `vis`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Adjust the options below to suit your needs.\n"
msgstr "Passe die folgenden Optionen an deine Bedürfnisse an.\n"
